```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant MP as Mercado Pago
    participant KAFKA as Kafka (payment-processed)
    participant CONSUMER as PaymentProcessedConsumer
    participant SVC as ReservaVacanteService
    participant NOTIF as ReservaVacanteNotificationFeignAdapter
    participant N8N as n8n Webhook

    MP->>KAFKA: Publica PaymentProcessedEvent
    KAFKA->>CONSUMER: Consume evento
    CONSUMER->>CONSUMER: Valida reservaVacanteId != null
    CONSUMER->>CONSUMER: Valida status == approved
    CONSUMER->>SVC: getStatus(reservaVacanteId)
    SVC-->>CONSUMER: ReservaVacante
    CONSUMER->>CONSUMER: setStatus("pagado")
    CONSUMER->>NOTIF: notifyPayment(reservaVacante, event)
    NOTIF->>N8N: POST /webhook/mercado-pago (N8nNotificationPayload)
    N8N-->>NOTIF: 200 OK
    NOTIF-->>CONSUMER: Notificación enviada
```